;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Erica.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\なつみ病室昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Shiyo 802, April 6　15:00―<PG>
―Right now, I'm alone in this hospital room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I burrow into the bed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To think finding out I'm <STYLE ID="1">Haruka's</STYLE> little sister would leave me feeling this sad...<PG>
The reason I got to learn we're sisters is that a life-or-death decision had to be made about <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whether <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> dies, or never wakes up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A truth revealed only so I could make that choice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If they were going to tell me anyway... I wish they'd told me sooner...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
It gets stuffy, so I poke my head out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sun is starting to sink.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The cherry blossoms are out too, the season when you feel how long the days are getting.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So it's already―April.<PG>
I can't see them from here, but the cherry blossoms must be delighting the people of Motoki-cho, and the tourists too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
People get drunk on the ephedrine said to be in cherry pollen, and grow giddy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is that what it meant, that everyone gets giddy when it warms up?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everyone but me must love this season.<PG>
Thinking about cherry blossoms has made my stomach start to hurt a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
I'll ask them to get a painkiller ready.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeees?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Excuse me, I'd like a painkiller, please."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okaaay, be right theeere!"<PG>
What are painkillers made of?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is it something like ephedrine, or something like the anesthesia they gave <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And soon it's going to be poured into my body.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\sliding_wooden_door_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
The door rattles open.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seems the nurse has come.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I'm back!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or so I thought, but it was <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I finally managed to squeeze a lot of information out of </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Did you find something out?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes! Some really promising information!"</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―After I got my painkiller shot, I went up to the roof with <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\病院屋上.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
These windless moments are precious, a time when I can breathe the outside air.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay, straight to it, then. We don't have much time, so I'll explain."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, please."</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Right now, with both the Megasawa City case and the Motoki-cho case, no investigation is being carried out because of </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">the suspect</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> being dead, and the case files were almost all buried. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">In the middle of all that, I finally found it. A small clue."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> holds a sheet of paper out to me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"This is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Eiichiro Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> autopsy results...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"There's an astonishing fact written in it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The autopsy on <STYLE ID="6">Haruka's dad</STYLE> was 14 years ago already.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the fact found after 14 years is―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\検死結果.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"'Drug similar to ephedrine detected'...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's right, it was detected in </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Eiichiro Niimura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> blood too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It all connects.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The drug in <STYLE ID="6">Haruka's dad's</STYLE> blood went by way of me and infected <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Did they figure out what the drug actually is?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Actually, it seems it stayed unidentified to the end."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What do you mean?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"The Sawa Prefectural Police got as far as it being </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="・・・・・">something like</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> ephedrine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">To identify what it really was, they asked the National Police Agency for help, apparently, but..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\病院屋上.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
............
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> leaves a strange pause here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Less like she's holding out for effect, more like she's <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ちゅうちょ">hesitating</STYLE> to say it out loud.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After a long, long few seconds pass, <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> speaks.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"The National Police Agency... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\検死結果2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">refused the request, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"They refused to do a detailed analysis, apparently."</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Why..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's not all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Eiichiro Niimura's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> accidental death―they were directed not to investigate it any further, apparently."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Huh!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't understand what <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> is saying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not only is the drug unidentified, but the National Police Agency refused it...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And on top of that, if even the investigation was made to stop, then...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\警察庁.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"To be precise, the National Police Agency did carry out the detailed analysis partway. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But after a few days, they gave that directive to the Sawa Prefectural Police, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um, um, um... that's, um..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, please calm down. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">In other words, the National Police Agency learned what the drug was, and told them to stop getting in any deeper."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Is it something that frightening...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"If it were only frightening, they wouldn't give a directive like that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">They judged that this drug becoming public would be extremely dangerous. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">You'd understand the reason, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, wouldn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um, um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The reason is precognition and... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> frenzy...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"For example, if your precognition, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, were used for crime or war..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"My danger sense, for crime or war―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Oh!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd never even thought of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I were kidnapped by a secret organization and put on the front lines of a war, I could sense the danger faster than anyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So as long as there's wind and cherry blossoms, I could be used as a weapon.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\病院屋上.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Am I... going to get kidnapped by some shadowy organization or something...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"That surely won't happen... What I said was just my imagination. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The question is, 'Why did the National Police Agency refuse the detailed analysis and halt the investigation?' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If they wanted to hide what the drug was, 'We couldn't determine it' would have been enough, but halting the investigation means </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Eiichiro Niimura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> accident was a seriously bad thing to have happened."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"In other words, okay?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　At the level of state secrets, both your precognition, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> frenzy may already have had their mechanisms worked out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That would mean they know what the drug is. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">It would be bad for that to get out to local police like Sawa Prefecture's or Motoki-cho's―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">in other words, to ordinary people."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um, um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">―you mean there are people who know how to cure her!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, well... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">it's a leap, but you could say that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"How can we meet them!? We can save </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Please calm down... Don't you think making contact with people like that is dangerous?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I don't! I've got intuition! I don't sense any danger right now!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"You don't sense danger because there's no wind right now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But, but, but, hasn't the chance of saving </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> gone up many times over!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, please listen carefully. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">What we need to do now isn't negotiate with the state. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Strictly within the help we can get from the hospital and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, we look for a way to save </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, please remember </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> own condition right now. Your whole body is in tatters..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay. I got a little too worked up..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Still, </STYLE>we were told <STYLE ID="1">Haruka's</STYLE> second round of anesthesia would be dangerous, so if they give it every 24 hours... 
{PAUSE ""}
the day after tomorrow―
{PAUSE ""}
before noon on April 8 is the time limit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's only a little over 40 hours left.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, even if there were a drug that could treat </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, it's not like they could use it on </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> within 40 hours, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"40 hours really is tough. Making a vaccine would take time too... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">It might be better not to think about treatment with medicine."</STYLE><PG>
Isn't there some good idea?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A way to get rid of the drug in <STYLE ID="1">Haruka's</STYLE> body within 40 hours.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A way to remove the drug from the blood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A way to remove the drug without relying on medicine is―<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"The wind's picking up a bit. Let's go inside."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Once the time limit passes, the second round of anesthesia will be needed.
