<STYLE ID="3">"No, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> adoptive parents have indeed passed away, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Niimura-senpai's birth mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is still alive. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> were cis-AB, what then?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Then there would be hope, but as I said earlier, one person's worth of blood is not enough. 
{PAUSE ""}
If anything, that is the bigger problem. 
{PAUSE ""}
Besides, with <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-san's</STYLE> strength as it is, I cannot recommend carrying out such a procedure recklessly. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-san</STYLE>, your blood pressure was also unstable from vomiting blood, so normally this is not something I could permit unless it were an emergency like this."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I understand. So this time, it's only </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Then, for <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-san</STYLE>, let us start preparing the exchange transfusion. 
{PAUSE ""}
By <STYLE ID="3">Goto-san's</STYLE> reasoning, this alone may ease <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-san's</STYLE> symptoms, so please do not be too anxious."<PG>
